(7908, 'itIT', 'Arena Master', 'There must be more to being a master of the arena than this!   Perhaps the Pirate who runs the event at Gurubashi will know!', 'Speak with Short John Mithril in the Stranglethorn Arena.', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0),
